OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 26 MAR
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GMark Forrest introduces an
OL,11,     Gafternoon of concert recordings
OL,12,     Gfrom the Czech Republic plus
OL,13,     Gchamber music by Vaughan Williams
OL,14,     Gand his contemporaries from
OL,15,     GLondon's LSO St. Luke's.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Thomas Ades
OL,17,     GThomas Ades tells Donald Macleod
OL,18,     Gabout the joys and challenges of
OL,19,     Gconducting his own music, and
OL,20,     Greveals the inspiration behind
OL,21,     Gone of his favourite orchestral
OL,22,     Gcreations.
